      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 三、口径问题：为什么用“平均”而非“期末”\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "净利润是全年流量，分母若用期末余额，会把“年末时"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "点状态”与“全年利润”错配。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "年内增发、回购、大额分红或季节性资产波动都会让期末"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "数失真。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "以示例说明：若年末回购使期末权益降至 350，误"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "用期末口径得 100 / 350 ≈ **28."
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "6%**，既高估 ROE，又因分子分母口径不一致"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "导致分解不闭合。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "因此：\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- 分母宜用平均余额（期初、期末均值或月度均值），"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "与流量口径匹配；\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- 三（五）个因子必须同用平均或同用期末，否则乘积"
