      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 四、分析用途与局限\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**用途**：横向识别同业 ROE 差异究竟来自"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "经营效率还是杠杆；纵向追踪驱动因子迁移，判断高 RO"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "E 是否可持续；借五因子区分“真实经营改善”与“"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "加杠杆、降税负”带来的账面提升。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**局限**：会计口径会扭曲分解结果——表外负债"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "、经营租赁、商誉、回购都会影响权益乘数与利润率，"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "需辅以现金流与风险指标交叉验证。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_b961b948adb147b5a779428b936ebd8b",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "此外，净利率与周转率常此消彼长（高毛利低周转 vs"
